---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Amiga Demo Music | CCG Eleventy Prototype
description: Browse Cheeky Commodore Gamer Amiga demoscene music features through a lightweight static archive that preserves the established music URLs.
permalink: /amiga-demo-music/index.html
---
<section class="hero hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">AMIGA MUSIC ARCHIVE PROTOTYPE</p>
  <h1>{{ amigaMusicArchive.name }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ amigaMusicArchive.description }}</p>
</section>

<section class="archive-browser" aria-labelledby="music-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="music-heading">Demo music features</h2>
    <p>{{ amigaMusicArchive.count }} source-backed entries are indexed here. Established <code>/amiga-demo-music/...</code> detail URLs are preserved while their richer page migration remains a separate validation milestone.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="collection-list">
    {% for entry in amigaMusicArchive.entries %}
      <article class="collection-summary">
        <h3><a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.title }}</a></h3>
        <p><a href="{{ entry.youtubeUrl }}">Watch on YouTube</a></p>
        {% if entry.membersOnly %}<p><strong>Members-only video</strong></p>{% endif %}
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
